{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9da4bf43896fffeaf195f12780ec5e4f1b3d16580b936527cbec43eb310412a2", "ja": "（リゾートウェディングの広告撮影で、\n南の島にやってきた。ロケは順調に進み……）", "zh": "（为了拍摄度假婚礼的广告，我们来到南方岛屿。\n拍摄十分顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b73e8fa9494b70d807ab6c85373a8cc1d346480ae64c48d1b5dd95ea1815b860", "ja": "恵美？\nどうかしたのか、ボーッとして。", "zh": "惠美，你怎么了吗？\n我看你在发呆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "aab054d1fb42d21f5d91138acb41bdf877a5788b128dd9a7650efbbfe2f30106", "ja": "{$P$}。もう、違うってば。\nボーッとしてたんじゃなくて、ひたってたの！", "zh": "{$P$}。唉唷，不是啦。\n我不是在发呆，我是沉浸在情绪之中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "0ae99189c02a2e8eed0b85c4ca7f6d6500b18978651c9ef58b5ae0a2d4e9f9bc", "ja": "だって、アタシがウェディングドレスを着て、\n花嫁やるなんて……なんか、夢みたいじゃん？", "zh": "你想想看，我穿上婚纱，扮演新娘耶……\n不觉得就像做梦一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "2988a9a7a3db28f37b2eea3da00fa29c41f204ea829762216fa8a53b001c98fc", "ja": "読モの時だって、あんなすごいドレス、着たコト\nなかったし。アイドルって、なんかスゴいんだねー。", "zh": "就连以前我当读者模特儿时，都没穿过那么棒的礼服。\n偶像真的很厉害耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a0a36ac207f37e0c37b58d51d57768d5aebda76049cb913b6e0581e2cfebe865", "ja": "でも、よく似合ってたよ。\n恵美はどうだった？　楽しめたか。", "zh": "不过你穿起来真的很好看喔。\n惠美，你自己觉得呢？拍得还开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "6d9718ef98287fdc0fe21a3086a1e766c38d8beebfdba394d773c29144b5cdd2", "ja": "うん！　最初は緊張したけど、チョー楽しかったよ。\nそれに、{$P$}が一緒だったしね。", "zh": "嗯！一开始虽然很紧张，但最后超开心的喔。\n而且，{$P$}也在旁边陪我嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "c4716bbebade207456181a51abee5b7bd65fbe3cfbbed26cf7219b63c69312a6", "ja": "撮影の間も{$P$}がそばに\nいてくれたから、想像しやすかったっていうか……。", "zh": "拍摄的时候{$P$}也在我身边，\n所以我就比较容易想像情景了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1009_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "5ea76d9ab08b6b1febdcc1bbf56c7ade2953b1b724725682bd6b2e89ed738b2e", "ja": "あ……えっと、ふ、深い意味はないからね！\nほら、緊張しなかったっていうか！　それだけ！", "zh": "啊……那个，我、我没有别的意思啦！\n就是，这样我比较不会紧张！只是这样而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a336ff39a867cd51da4691c825c463498b35df64361c08e3e9c126dcac085469", "ja": "ああ、そうか。\n役に立ったならよかったよ。", "zh": "这样啊，原来如此。\n很高兴能帮上你的忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "ff6a5d1ca9b4151878b54be17a4c6889c6ca4cd63f0af27ec3b81154175dd2f1", "ja": "そ、そう！　すっごく役に立った！\nめちゃくちゃ役に立ったからね！　ありがとっ！", "zh": "对、对啊！真的帮了我一个大忙！\n超级大的忙！谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "50e4c7c623c58bfb7ed2f117ba555720d7c7d174d83e907f23c9f1cf1f1f8ed8", "ja": "いやー、なんか熱くなってきちゃったなー！\n……よしっ！　アタシ、ちょっと泳いでくる！", "zh": "唉唷～怎么好像变热啦～！\n……好！我去游个泳吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "34fd896ca4ed7318de341f19bfc3cd7d3205c23fbf89e772dcb34dc2941d6ece", "ja": "え？　泳ぐって……今からか？", "zh": "咦？游泳……现在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "508295109acf45dfa32c98d63134ac5998adc87d70eaf66f096d79f7bf029169", "ja": "もちろん！\n{$P$}もおいでよ、ホラホラ！", "zh": "对啊！\n{$P$}也一起来游泳嘛，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0053_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0ff5aa4346999b72a29a3c137a84cc9ee1aa42f24e5c2e5e53cbf49b62a8958b", "ja": "いや、俺はスーツだし……こ、こら、引っ張るなって！\nうわーっ！？", "zh": "不是啊，我现在穿西装……喂、喂！别拉我！\n哇──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
